<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="site-wrap home-hero__inner">
    <div class="home-hero__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Software engineer · Porto</p>
      <h1 class="home-hero__title">I build products that help people do their work.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I've spent over 15 years writing code and leading the teams who write it, on everything from conservation tools to payments. Today I'm AI Lead at <a href="https://mindera.com">Mindera</a> and founder of <a href="https://kronflow.com">Kronflow</a>. Before that I was CTO at <a href="https://platforme.com">PlatformE</a> and Head of Engineering at <a href="https://www.teya.com">Switch</a>.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <%= link_to "Get in touch", "#contact", class: "btn-site btn-site--primary" %>
        <%= link_to "Read the blog", blog_path, class: "btn-site btn-site--outline" %>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="home-hero__figure">
      <%= image_tag "/images/porto_daylight_tall_800.jpg",
            srcset: { "/images/porto_daylight_tall_800.jpg" => "800w", "/images/porto_daylight_tall_1100.jpg" => "1100w", "/images/porto_daylight_tall_1600.jpg" => "1600w" },
            sizes: "(min-width: 1100px) 460px, calc(100vw - 32px)", width: 1600, height: 1867, fetchpriority: "high",
            alt: "Daytime view across the city to the Atlantic, under a blue sky with scattered clouds",
            class: "home-hero__photo" %>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="site-wrap home-section" aria-labelledby="topics-heading">
  <h2 id="topics-heading" class="section-title">Ask me about</h2>
  <div class="topic-grid">
    <article class="topic-card">
      <p class="topic-card__num">01</p>
      <h3 class="topic-card__title">Gen AI across the PDLC</h3>
      <p class="topic-card__text">How we're bringing generative AI into the whole product development lifecycle at Mindera, from best practices to training and coaching.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="topic-card">
      <p class="topic-card__num">02</p>
      <h3 class="topic-card__title">AI agents in real codebases</h3>
      <p class="topic-card__text">What I've learned using agents on real projects, and how they're changing the developer's job. I've <%= link_to "written about the hurdles", article_path("hurdles-of-building-with-ai-agents") %> too.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="topic-card">
      <p class="topic-card__num">03</p>
      <h3 class="topic-card__title">Shape Up in practice</h3>
      <p class="topic-card__text">I introduced it at PlatformE to speed up delivery. Happy to share what stuck and what didn't.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="topic-card">
      <p class="topic-card__num">04</p>
      <h3 class="topic-card__title">Engineering through an acquisition</h3>
      <p class="topic-card__text">I ran engineering at Switch through its acquisition by SaltPay, then helped bring our product and team into the larger company.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="site-wrap home-section" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
  <h2 id="how-heading" class="section-title">How I like to work</h2>
  <ol class="principles">
    <li class="principle">
      <p class="principle__num" aria-hidden="true">1</p>
      <h3 class="principle__title">Think about the people who'll use it.</h3>
      <p class="principle__text">You are not your user, and people don't always ask for what they need. That's why I care so much about UX.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="principle">
      <p class="principle__num" aria-hidden="true">2</p>
      <h3 class="principle__title">Fixed time, flexible scope.</h3>
      <p class="principle__text">When I can, I use Shape Up: decide how much time something is worth, then shape the work to fit.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="principle">
      <p class="principle__num" aria-hidden="true">3</p>
      <h3 class="principle__title">Stay hands-on.</h3>
      <p class="principle__text">I still write code, at work and on Kronflow.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="principle">
      <p class="principle__num" aria-hidden="true">4</p>
      <h3 class="principle__title">Ruby on Rails by default.</h3>
      <p class="principle__text">It's my first choice for building products, but I go with what suits the team. At PlatformE I learned Django instead.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="site-wrap home-section" aria-labelledby="where-heading">
  <h2 id="where-heading" class="label-title">Where I've done it</h2>
  <ul class="org-list">
    <li><a href="https://mindera.com">Mindera</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://platforme.com">PlatformE</a></li>
    <%# Switch's own site is gone; it was acquired by SaltPay, since renamed Teya %>
    <li><a href="https://www.teya.com">Switch</a><span class="org-list__note">now part of Teya</span></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.vizzuality.com">Vizzuality</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.unep-wcmc.org/">UNEP-WCMC</a></li>
  </ul>
  <%= link_to "The longer story →", about_path, class: "text-link" %>
</section>

<section class="site-wrap home-section">
  <div class="feature-block">
    <div class="feature-block__text">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">What I'm building</p>
      <h2 class="feature-block__title">Kronflow</h2>
      <p class="feature-block__sub">Track hours and budgets, and see which projects actually make money. Built for small teams, in English and Portuguese.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="https://kronflow.com" class="btn-site btn-site--light">Visit kronflow.com ↗</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="site-wrap home-contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
  <h2 id="contact-heading" class="home-contact__title">Want to work together?</h2>
  <p class="home-contact__text">I'm available for mentoring, advisory, consulting and talks, mostly on Gen AI adoption, engineering leadership and Shape Up.</p>
  <%= mail_to "mailme@simaobelchior.com", class: "btn-site btn-site--primary btn-site--lg" %>
  <%= render "shared/social_links", class_name: "home-contact__links" %>
</section>
